  Description: You were an object until the moon breathed life into you. Choose one
    Lore skill related to what kind of tool you were; for instance, Cooking Lore
    for a cleaver or Farming Lore for a rake. You become trained in this skill. Humanoid
    Form You retain memories of the tasks you performed as an object. You gain a
    +1 circumstance bonus to the Lore skill you obtained through this heritage. Yaoguai
    Form Your time as a mindless object makes it harder to affect you mentally. If
    you roll a success on a mental effect, you gain a critical success instead.
